 	  (4:2:0) or NV16 (4:2:2) frames. The device compatible selects the
 	  register layout and address width; unrecognized revisions are refused.
+	  On T8132 each engine also decodes baseline JPEG (4:4:4, 4:2:2,
+	  4:2:0) to NV12 or NV16 through a second, decoder node.
 
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
 	  will be called apple-jpeg.
@@ -22,5 +24,6 @@ config VIDEO_APPLE_JPEG_KUNIT_TEST
 	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
 	help
 	  Check engine identification, the quantisation tables and every
-	  register write of 4:2:0 and 4:2:2 encode jobs. No hardware is
+	  register write of 4:2:0 and 4:2:2 encode jobs, the JPEG header
+	  parser and decode jobs. No hardware is
 	  needed.
